{
  "roadmap_name": "RealPathFlow",
  "description": "DSA + Data Science, IITM BS Track — 4 parallel Main Tasks, time-share weighted, running across 4 macro Phases (Year 1 -> Year 4.5).",
  "version": "1.0",

  "notes_for_engine": [
    "This file is a TEMPLATE, not a day-by-day log. The Phase 2 loader expands it into actual main_tasks/sub_tasks rows (one row per real calendar date) by combining: (1) the weekly_schedule below for the day-of-week, (2) the active phase for that date from the phases table, and (3) any exam_week flag the user sets for IITM term-end weeks.",
    "time_share for each Main Task on a given day is NOT hardcoded — the engine computes it live as: (that Main Task's planned_seconds that day) / (sum of planned_seconds of every Main Task active that day). This matches schema.sql's main_tasks.time_share column, which the loader fills in at generation time.",
    "Main Task D (Portfolio & Community): on any day where zero of its sub_tasks are scheduled, D is NOT generated as a row at all that day -- no box, not counted in the day's total planned time. This was an explicit decision, not a default.",
    "Phase table below changes WHAT fills Main Task B's and C's sub-tasks (difficulty level / problem type), it does not change the structure (order, count, or duration) of sub-tasks -- store phase-driven content as metadata on the sub-task row (e.g. 'difficulty: Easy'), not as a new sub-task."
  ],

  "phases": [
    {
      "phase": 1,
      "duration_label": "Yr 1 - 1.5 (T1-4)",
      "iitm_level": "Foundation",
      "dsa_focus": "Syntax, Arrays, Recursion, Sorting",
      "dsa_difficulty": "Easy",
      "ds_focus": "EDA, Data Cleaning (starts Month 6)",
      "milestone": "LeetCode Easy x100",
      "weekly_contest_active": false
    },
    {
      "phase": 2,
      "duration_label": "Yr 1.5 - 3 (T5-9)",
      "iitm_level": "Diploma (Programming + Data Science)",
      "dsa_focus": "Trees, Graphs, DP, Heaps, Two-Pointers",
      "dsa_difficulty": "Medium",
      "ds_focus": "Kaggle Beginner competitions",
      "milestone": "300+ solved; internship applications (Month 18-24)",
      "weekly_contest_active": false
    },
    {
      "phase": 3,
      "duration_label": "Yr 3 - 4.5 (T10-13)",
      "iitm_level": "BSc/BS + Capstone",
      "dsa_focus": "Advanced Graphs, Hard patterns, LLD/HLD",
      "dsa_difficulty": "Hard",
      "ds_focus": "Tabular/NLP competitions, MLOps stack",
      "milestone": "500+ solved; 6-month SDE/ML internship",
      "weekly_contest_active": true
    },
    {
      "phase": 4,
      "duration_label": "Yr 4 - 4.5",
      "iitm_level": "Placement",
      "dsa_focus": "Mock interviews, HLD mastery",
      "dsa_difficulty": "Hard (interview-pattern)",
      "ds_focus": "Portfolio finalization",
      "milestone": "SDE-1 / DE / MLE placement (30-50 LPA target)",
      "weekly_contest_active": true
    }
  ],

  "main_tasks": [
